  "details": "This seems to effect Oculus and steam clients, When u look at a name plate from a distance away there is a redish orange color mixed into the name plate when people are not talking. When they do talk the name plate lights up and the color goes away. This has been seen for about a month or 2 (not from the recent update). It happens in VR and desktop. ",
